# edge cases from a request must give an error or a result, not a crash
Server init.

Imveliso bhala: ['<'] + (['abc'] ukusuka: 0 ubude: 0, oonobumba-abakhulu) + ['>'], umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['<'] + (['abc'] ukusuka: 0 ubude: 0, oonobumba-abancinci) + ['>'], umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['<'] + (['abc'] tsiba: 3, oonobumba-abakhulu) + ['>'], umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: [''] oonobumba-abakhulu bytes, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['aB'] oonobumba-abakhulu, umgca-omtsha.
Imveliso bhala: ['aB'] oonobumba-abancinci, umgca-omtsha.

Imveliso bhala: (Ixesha entsha: 0) unyaka, umgca-omtsha.
{ Ixesha entsha: ['9e300'] inani. } bamba: { :e Imveliso bhala: e, umgca-omtsha. }, qala.
{ Ixesha entsha: ['-9e300'] inani. } bamba: { :e Imveliso bhala: e, umgca-omtsha. }, qala.
{ Ixesha entsha: ['nan'] inani. } bamba: { :e Imveliso bhala: e, umgca-omtsha. }, qala.
{ Ixesha entsha: 9000000000000000000. } bamba: { :e Imveliso bhala: e, umgca-omtsha. }, qala.
